    {
      "key": "calculation-copy",
      "parent": "article",
      "html": "<div layer-name=\"Start with USD 10,000. The first period raises the balance to USD 15,000. Losing half of that balance in the next period leaves USD 7,500. There are no deposits, withdrawals, fees or taxes in this example.\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;font-family:Inter,Noto Sans SC,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:26px;font-weight:400;color:#51555b;line-height:28px;padding:0 0 18px;\">Start with USD 10,000. The first period raises the balance to USD 15,000. Losing half of that balance in the next period leaves USD 7,500. There are no deposits, withdrawals, fees or taxes in this example.</div>"
    },
