      "html": "<div layer-name=\"Compare the averages\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;font-family:Inter,Noto Sans SC,sans-serif;font-size:23px;line-height:34px;font-weight:600;color:#1a1c20;line-height:31px;padding:0 0 14px;\">Compare the averages</div>"
    },
    {
      "key": "averages-copy",
      "parent": "article",
      "html": "<div layer-name=\"The arithmetic average is 0%. The total return is −25% over two years. The compound annual return is about −13.4% per year. These measures answer different questions, so the period and unit stay beside the number.\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;font-family:Inter,Noto Sans SC,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:26px;font-weight:400;color:#51555b;line-height:28px;padding:0 0 16px;\">The arithmetic average is 0%. The total return is −25% over two years. The compound annual return is about −13.4% per year. These measures answer different questions, so the period and unit stay beside the number.</div>"
    },
    {
      "key": "equations",
      "parent": "article",
      "html": "<div layer-name=\"Exact arithmetic\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;padding:16px 18px;background:#f0f0ed;border-radius:8px;\"><div layer-name=\"Total return = (7,500 / 10,000) − 1 = −25%.\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;font-family:Inter,Noto Sans SC,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;font-weight:400;color:#1a1c20;\">Total return = (7,500 / 10,000) − 1 = −25%.</div><div layer-name=\"CAGR = (7,500 / 10,000)^(1/2) − 1 ≈ −13.4% per year.\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;font-family:Inter,Noto Sans SC,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;font-weight:400;color:#1a1c20;\">CAGR = (7,500 / 10,000)^(1/2) − 1 ≈ −13.4% per year.</div></div>"
    },
