    {
      "key": "limits-copy",
      "parent": "article",
      "html": "<div layer-name=\"Reordering the same returns does not change the final balance when no cash enters or leaves. Contributions and withdrawals change that relationship. A fixed-rate calculator describes assumptions; it does not predict future returns.\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;font-family:Inter,Noto Sans SC,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:26px;font-weight:400;color:#51555b;line-height:28px;padding:0 0 24px;\">Reordering the same returns does not change the final balance when no cash enters or leaves. Contributions and withdrawals change that relationship. A fixed-rate calculator describes assumptions; it does not predict future returns.</div>"
